        "original_id": "82c47c34-bea4-5475-b0a6-266683e208f7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Dolmayan, Greg Costikyan, Serj Tankian, Daron Malakian, Shavo Odadjian\n- Organizations: System of a Down, Sirius XM\n- Roles: drummer, songwriter, game designer, science fiction writer, lead vocalist, keyboardist, guitarist, bassist\n- Products: PopRocks\n\nFacts:\n- Greg Costikyan was born on July 22, 1959, in New York City.\n- Greg Costikyan is an American game designer and science fiction writer who is sometimes known by the pseudonym Designer X.\n- John Hovig Dolmayan was born on July 15, 1973.\n- John Hovig Dolmayan is a Lebanese-born Armenian-American songwriter and drummer.\n- System of a Down currently consists of Serj Tankian on lead vocals and keyboards, Daron Malakian on vocals and guitar, Shavo Odadjian on bass and backing vocals, and John Dolmayan on drums.\n- PopRocks debuted on Sirius XM on August 17, 2017, as a full-time channel devoted to pop music and rock music.\n- PopRocks has featured pop artists such as Goo Goo Dolls, Train, and Sheryl Crow, and rock artists such as Metallica and System of a Down.",
